  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Northern Plains, Yin Wu Que retreats constantly while pointing his finger at Hei Lou Lan. A crisp sound of unsheathing blades follows. A translucent pale blue crescent moon shoots from the ground like a sword toward her. She is prepared and jumps at almost the same time, avoiding it.",
      "chapters": [
        2169
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_yin_wu_que",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yin Wu Que’s pupils contract slightly. He finds this move very fast, and that ordinary Gu Immortals cannot dodge it easily. He takes her success as showing that she has an exceptional investigative killer move. He thinks the method has only failed against Tian Xia Xin, a wisdom path Gu Immortal capable of deductions, and Zhou Ye Zi, who cultivates time path and had an investigative method that could peer a few breaths into the future. He then thinks that even though this mysterious female immortal cultivates strength path, she is not to be underestimated, and he keeps retreating at the same time.",
      "chapters": [
        2169
      ],
